+/* Edge Zlib (Sony's SPU inflate service, statically linked into BLUS30966's
+ * Budokai 3: "edgeZlibTaskSet", "inflate 1.2.3") feeds its SPURS task a
+ * 32-byte element through an ANY2ANY LFQueue:
