+     * object depends on the SPU program: the launcher's consumer waits on
+     * queue+5, Budokai 3's Edge Zlib inflate task (image spu_0003, the only
+     * consumer of its LFQueue) on the queue EA itself -- with only q+5 it was
+     * never woken, nothing was inflated, and the title parsed its archives
+     * still gzip-compressed. Any wait object inside the queue's 128-byte line
+     * is this queue. */
+    extern int spu_taskset_signal_parked_wait_range(uint32_t lo, uint32_t hi);
+    int woken = spu_taskset_signal_parked_wait_range(q, q + 128u);
