+/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ * Micro-interpreter for RUNTIME-GENERATED stub code (SMC).
+ *
+ * The WWS jobmanager's interrupt handler GENERATES a register save/restore
+ * stub above the static image (LS 0x3FEC0: a chain of stqd/lqd plus a `bi`
